  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "개찰구를 지나면...<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CCC30AD6CB97C0020C9C0B098BA74002E002E002E00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개찰구를 지나면 포켓몬과 함께하는\n눈부신 나날이 펼쳐질 거예요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n먼 지방에서 오셨다면\n미르의 거리 풍경에 깜짝 놀라실걸요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CCC30AD6CB97C0020C9C0B098BA740020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020D568AED8D558B294000AB208BD80C2E00020B098B0A0C7740020D3BCCCD0C9C80020AC70C608C694002100100001BE01000ABA3C0020C9C0BC29C5D0C11C0020C624C168B2E4BA74000ABBF8B974C7580020AC70B9AC0020D48DACBDC5D00020AE5CC9DD0020B180B77CC2E4AC78C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부가 하고 싶네!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80AC000020D558ACE00020C2F6B124002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에서는\n자극적인 포켓몬 승부가 하고 싶네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0C11CB294000AC790ADF9C801C7780020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80AC000020D558ACE00020C2F6B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르에는 카페가 잔뜩 있으니까, 아빠라면\n어디로 갈지 정하는 데 한참 걸릴 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C5D0B2940020CE74D398AC000020C794B7290020C788C73CB2C8AE4C002C0020C544BE60B77CBA74000AC5B4B514B85C0020AC08C9C00020C815D558B2940020B3700020D55CCC380020AC78B9B40020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한숨 돌릴 겸 카페에나 갈까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55CC2280020B3CCB9B40020ACB80020CE74D398C5D0B0980020AC08AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "13시간이나 비행기에 탔더니\n아무래도 좀 지치네...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00310033C2DCAC04C774B0980020BE44D589AE30C5D00020D0D4B354B2C8000AC544BB34B798B3C40020C8800020C9C0CE58B124002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 포켓몬을 만나게 될지\n너무 기대돼!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020B9CCB098AC8C0020B420C9C0000AB108BB340020AE30B300B3FC00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티는 도시 안에도\n야생 포켓몬이 살고 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B2940020B3C4C2DC0020C548C5D0B3C4000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C0B4ACE00020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티다!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B2E4002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗, 정말 큰 여행 가방이네요.\n미르시티에서 즐거운 관광 되세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C557002C0020C815B9D00020D0700020C5ECD5890020AC00BC29C774B124C694002E000ABBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0C11C0020C990AC70C6B40020AD00AD110020B418C138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "최근 미르시티에 일어난\n변화에 대해 조사할 생각이에요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD5CADFC0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D00020C77CC5B4B09C000ABCC0D654C5D00020B300D5740020C870C0ACD5600020C0DDAC01C774C5D0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르는 역사가 깊으면서도\n도전적인 도시거든요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974B2940020C5EDC0ACAC000020AE4AC73CBA74C11CB3C4000AB3C4C804C801C7780020B3C4C2DCAC70B4E0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티 도착!\n나를 크게 환영해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F00020B3C4CC290021000AB098B97C0020D06CAC8C0020D658C601D5740020C918002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "환영받을 수 있도록\n나도 진심으로 미르시티를 즐길 생각이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D658C601BC1BC7440020C2180020C788B3C4B85D000AB098B3C40020C9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B97C0020C990AE380020C0DDAC01C774C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우선 호텔에 짐부터 두고\n거리를 산책해 볼까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C1200020D638D154C5D00020C9D0BD80D1300020B450ACE0000AAC70B9ACB97C0020C0B0CC45D5740020BCFCAE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "칼로스지방에 왔다는 실감!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D00020C654B2E4B2940020C2E4AC10002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "차창 바깥 풍경을 보면서\n칼로스지방에 왔다는 실감이 들었어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC28CC3D0020BC14AE650020D48DACBDC7440020BCF4BA74C11C000ACE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D00020C654B2E4B2940020C2E4AC10C7740020B4E4C5C8C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "공항에서 미르시티까지\n의외로 멀었지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACF5D56DC5D0C11C0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0AE4CC9C0000AC758C678B85C0020BA40C5C8C9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파트너 포켓몬이 있으면\n혼자 여행하는 것쯤은 간단해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CD2B8B1080020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C73CBA74000AD63CC7900020C5ECD589D558B2940020AC83CBE4C7400020AC04B2E8D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "열차의 승차감이 너무 좋아서\n깜빡 잠들어 버리고 말았어",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5F4CC28C7580020C2B9CC28AC10C7740020B108BB340020C88BC544C11C000AAE5CBE610020C7A0B4E4C5B40020BC84B9ACACE00020B9D0C558C5B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
